<title>JAPAN: US, Japan to talk on ship sanctions--Japan official.</title>
<headline>US, Japan to talk on ship sanctions--Japan official.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States and Japan are certain to hold talks on a decision by the U.S. Federal Maritime Commission (FMC) to impose retaliatory surcharges on Japanese vessels calling at U.S. ports, a Japanese government official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There will certainly be government-to-government talks, possibly even next week,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
</text>
